GIVEN `the enactment is the Supreme Court of Judicature Act 1969` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 70 r 1 the enactment is the Act` MEANS
    IF `the enactment is the Supreme Court of Judicature Act 1969`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): ""Act" means the Supreme Court of Judicature Act 1969"

