-- src:7729 | 4. —(1) Where an order under section 74(1) is in force against a person, an application by that person for permission under section 74(1) to institute any legal proceedings, or to continue any legal proceedings instituted by that person before the making of that order, and the supporting affidavit for that application, must be served — ( a )
