      `the application and supporting affidavit have been served on every other party to the legal proceedings to be instituted or continued` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 70 r 4(1) the application and affidavit are served as the Rule requires` MEANS
    IF `the duty to serve the application and affidavit arises` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN IF `the application and supporting affidavit have been served on the Attorney-General` AND `the application and supporting affidavit have been served on every other party to the legal proceedings to be instituted or continued`
